      "id": 475602,
      "username": "lisynafuyi",
      "name": null,
      "created_at": "2025-07-29T10:21:35.767Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The error <a href=\"https://certera.com/kb/how-to-fix-the-err-connection-timed-out-error/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">ERR_CONNECTION_TIMED_OUT</a> does not indicate a dangerous problem or an infected file that can harm your system. Instead, it denotes that the system could not connect successfully with the target server. This connection facilitates the transfer of data packets between the two systems. But, when this connection establishment process fails, which can be due to a “n” number of issues, such as a bad local network connection. There are ‘n’ number of reasons for the error to be occured which are as follows:-</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Invalid URL</li>\n<li>Slow internet connection</li>\n<li>Firewall settings</li>\n<li>Server delay or error</li>\n</ol>\n<p>There are many different ways to fix the error which can be able to solve the  error issue. Hope it helps!</p>",
